  "_bridge_comment": "Pure, lossless reshaping of the real, validated 2026100005_ENTRY_SNAPSHOT.json (NEO Sync schema: records[]/player_code) into the older entries[]/player_id shape klpga.knowledge_engine.player_intelligence_generator.players_for_tournament() and TournamentContext.artifact_path(\"entry_snapshot\") expect (the shape scripts/15_collect_entry_list.py and OK_OPEN_2026_ENTRY_SNAPSHOT.json / other pre-NEO-Sync tournaments already use). No field is invented: player_code is renamed to player_id (same official KLPGA identity, confirmed in klpga.collectors.aggregate as the same identity space), entry_status is the literal fact that every record here appeared on the official entry list, and identity_match/canonical_name (present in the older per-tournament collectors, which ran their own separate name-normalization pass) are omitted rather than guessed, since no equivalent identity-normalization step has run for this game_code."
